  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to Amos 2:6, what did Israel do that the text names as its transgression?', 'Amos 2:6', 'For three transgressions of Israel, yes, for four, I will not turn away its punishment, because they have sold the righteous for silver, and the needy for a pair of sandals.', 'WEB', 2,
